# Design Tokens Push Reminder

Whenever changes are made to `design-token-gallery.html` or `design-tokens-spec.md`, remind the user and ask if they want to push the changes upstream.

**Prompt after editing:**
> I've updated the design token files. Do you want to push these changes upstream to the remote repository?